    "bbox": [
      49.68,
      581.13,
      565.4,
      690.24
    ],
    "text": "Flood Situation may occur within the next 48 hours in the low-lying areas belonging to the floodplains of the Kuda Ganga and Maguru Ganga in the Bulathsinhala, Madurawala, and Palindanuwara Divisional Secretariat Divisions. Consequently, there is a risk of by-roads running through the low-lying areas around the Kuda Ganga and Maguru Ganga becoming inundated. The public living in these areas and motorists traveling through them are requested to act with caution regarding this situation. Furthermore, disaster management authorities are requested to take the necessary actions in this regard.",
